  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654375/PTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PTI</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 23, 2026 at 07:40 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bhubaneswar: The <a href=\"/tag/department+of+burns+and+plastic+surgery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Department of Burns and Plastic Surgery</a> at <a href=\"/tag/aiims-bhubaneswar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIIMS-Bhubaneswar</a> has been selected as the third institute in the country to serve as a national-level training centre for <a href=\"/tag/burn+injury+management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">burn injury management</a>, officials said on Sunday.The recognition follows approval from the Union Ministry of Health and Family Welfare under the National Programme for Prevention and Management of Trauma and Burn Injuries (NPPMT&amp;BI), they said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The department's selection acknowledges its expertise in specialised burn care, clinical excellence, medical education and capacity building, they added.Marking its 10th anniversary this year, the department has treated more than 1,500 burn patients over the past decade, contributing to improved clinical outcomes and quality of life, a senior institute official said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>AIIMS Bhubaneswar Executive Director Ashutosh Biswas said the institute was committed to supporting the Centre's efforts to strengthen trauma and burn care services and develop a skilled healthcare workforce capable of providing quality emergency and specialised treatment across the country.Sanjay Kumar Giri, head of the department, said its infrastructure and clinical experience would help it share expertise through structured training programmes and contribute to developing skilled healthcare professionals.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Under the NPPMT&amp;BI, the Centre has sanctioned 196 <a href=\"/tag/trauma+care+facilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">trauma care facilities</a> and 47 burn units across the country to strengthen infrastructure and ensure timely and quality treatment for patients.</p><p>State governments and Union Territory administrations have been asked to nominate suitable healthcare professionals for the training programmes.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654375/PTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PTI</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 23, 2026 at 07:40 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 23, 2026 at 07:40 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=